    "short_description": "Bloomberg L.P. is a privately held American company based in Midtown Manhattan, New York City. Founded in 1981 by Michael Bloomberg and others, it specializes in financial software, data, and media. The company provides real-time financial information, analytics, news, and trading tools primarily for financial professionals and organizations around the world.\n\nBloomberg's core offerings include the Bloomberg Terminal, an integrated software platform that delivers real-time price data and trading capabilities. The company also offers enterprise applications, industry-specific products, and a range of media services, including Bloomberg News, Bloomberg Television, and Bloomberg Radio. With over 19,000 employees and a global presence across multiple continents, Bloomberg serves a diverse clientele, including financial institutions, corporate enterprises, government agencies, and professionals in various industries. Its services aim to enhance transparency and efficiency in global markets.",
